\newlabel{fig:ic_sensitivity}{{6}{21}{Initial condition sensitivity test. Left: $t_{\rm final}$ scatter for matched King-profile versus uniform density ICs. Right: $t_{\rm final}$ bar chart for each parameter point. Both IC types classify every point identically (all STABLE)}{figure.6}{}}
