\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Equation of state sensitivity test. Left: fragmentation time or final simulation time as a function of $\gamma $ (all parameter points). Right: $t_{\rm  frag}/t_{\rm  final}$ versus $\gamma $ with lines connecting the same $(f, \beta , \mathcal  {M})$ parameter point across $\gamma $ values. Sub-isothermal EOS ($\gamma < 1$) systematically reduces $t_{\rm  frag}$.}}{22}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
